      "rules_text": "When you choose not to equip armor, you have a base Armor \nScore of 3 + your Strength and use the following as your base \ndamage thresholds:\n ◦ Tier 1: 9/19 \n ◦ Tier 2: 11/24 \n ◦ Tier 3: 13/31\n ◦ Tier 4: 15/38",
      "notes": null
